Acceptance criteria:
  [x] All web states reproduced via UiState->ChartStatus: loading, error+retry, empty, content, stale, offline.
  [x] Hooks bind to shared P1/S8 state-holder (UiState<List<ChargingSpeedSession>>); no HTTP in the view.
  [x] Every i18n key resolves through P1/S10 (charging.curve.*). 9 keys pre-existed; 2 added (see i18n NOTE).
  [x] Accessibility: ChartContainer accessibleDescription (aria), legend swatch contentDescriptions, freshness chip.
  [x] Tests: adapter unit test (11 cases) + per-state UI/a11y test (SpeedTrendChartUiTest) + a11y label assertions.
