NOTE (i18n / P1/S10 predecessor completion): the web source resolves charging.curve.speedTrendDesc and
  charging.curve.speedTrend.aria via inline t() DEFAULTS — neither key existed in the catalog, and
  'speedTrend.aria' is structurally unrepresentable beside the existing 'speedTrend' string. Added the two
  canonical keys to web/src/i18n/en.json (speedTrendDesc, speedTrendAria) and materialized them into the
  Android catalog (values, values-ar, values-he). A full gen-i18n regen was intentionally NOT bundled: the
  committed resources carried pre-existing drift (entry count 7779 vs en.json 7798) and regen would have
  swept ~17 unrelated keys + rewritten the Apple/Windows resources into this Android-surface change.

